                                "sense_id": "79a8462c-b4bc-356a-8f1d-0c85533dc930",
                                "text": "Word is the club's crazily rich Middle Eastern owner's have got wind of the player's sorrow and, according to Maxifoot, are preparing an offer \"worthy of a pharaoh\" for Ronaldo, who has long been considered a mummy's boy."
                            },
                            {
