                                "sense_id": "79a8462c-b4bc-356a-8f1d-0c85533dc930",
                                "text": "With this crazily brilliant, pocket-sized hotel clinging like an eagle's lair to the cliffs just outside Sorrento, owner Marco DeLuca has created somewhere that's so much more than just a place to sleep."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70335855-7c82-4a36-9056-9b28429ec25e",
                                "sense_id": "79a8462c-b4bc-356a-8f1d-0c85533dc930",
                                "text": "We have worked crazily long hours and it has been gruelling, exhausting."
                            }
                        ]
